OL,3,GNEWSADeaths prompt coroner's
OL,4,Ainvestigation support concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article references suicide and
OL,7,Fcontains details some readers may find
OL,8,Fupsetting. If you, or someone you know,
OL,9,Fare struggling with the issues raised
OL,10,Fin this article, support and
OL,11,Finformation is available at BBC Action
OL,12,FLine.
OL,14,FA coroner has concluded five men in
OL,15,Feight months died by suicide while
OL,16,Fbeing investigated by the police in the
OL,17,Fsame county.
