OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADeaths prompt coroner's
OL,4,Ainvestigation support concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobert Cohen heard the inquests of the
OL,7,Fmen who died in Cumbria between October
OL,8,F2025 and June 2026 while on bail for
OL,9,Falleged offences. Four of the deaths
OL,10,Fhappened within seven weeks.
OL,12,FThe assistant coroner told the court in
OL,13,FWorkington he would write to the
OL,14,FCollege of Policing and two Secretaries
OL,15,Fof State over his "very significant
OL,16,Fconcerns" about rising numbers of
OL,17,Fpeople taking their own lives while
OL,18,Funder investigation.
